:09Z","body":"all_constraints: ~11k\r\nall_cons_columns: ~14k\r\n\r\nuser_constraints: ~400\r\nuser_cons_columns: ~400","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/463047528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"funseiki","id":669439,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2OTQzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/669439?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki","html_url":"https://github.com/funseiki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funseiki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/463276607","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4486#issuecomment-463276607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4486","id":463276607,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2MzI3NjYwNw==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-02-13T16:52:16Z","updated_at":"2019-02-13T16:52:38Z","body":"I haven't dealt with Oracle EXPLAIN PLAN output in a very long time and it's a bit inconvenient, can you see if moving the \"all_*\" into subqueries so they act more like views helps anything?   all of the reflection code works against the `\"ALL_*\"` views so we can't just change those to `\"USER_\"`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\tSELECT\r\n\tac.constraint_name,\r\n\tac.constraint_type,\r\n\tloc.column_name AS local_column,\r\n\trem.table_name AS remote_table,\r\n\trem.column_name AS remote_column,\r\n\trem.owner AS remote_owner,\r\n\tloc.position as loc_pos,\r\n\trem.position as rem_pos,\r\n\tac.search_condition,\r\n\tac.delete_rule\r\n\tFROM \r\n\t\t(SELECT * FROM all_constraints WHERE owner = 'scott') ac,\r\n\t\t(SELECT * FROM all_cons_columns WHERE owner = 'scott') loc,\r\n\t\t(SELECT * FROM all_cons_columns WHERE owner = 'scott') rem\r\n\tWHERE ac.table_name = :table_name\r\n\tAND ac.constraint_type IN ('R','P', 'U', 'C')\r\n\tAND ac.constraint_name = loc.constraint_name\r\n\tAND ac.r_constraint_name = rem.constraint_name(+)\r\n\tAND (rem.position IS NULL or loc.position=rem.position)\r\n\tORDER BY ac.constraint_name, loc.position\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/463276607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus